<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_768e18f1eeabdbc60efa436a98e404979a7b66e6f8b22133183e14bad0dcbfba_n0061/na_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_768e18f1eeabdbc60efa436a98e404979a7b66e6f8b22133183e14bad0dcbfba_n0061/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "2) Surgery for valvular endocarditis and intraoperative complete AVB Immediate epicardial pacemaker implantation should be considered in patients with surgery for valvular endocarditis and complete AVB if one of the following predictors of persistence is present: pre-operative conduction abnormality, Staphylococcus aureus infection, intracardiac abscess, tricuspid valve involvement, or previous valvular surgery.481" .
